      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is expected behavior. On live, gesture locking functions this way and many use that functionality. If it was changed, it'd need to be an option.\n\nEG: On live, I do an emote and use locking to freeze the emote. I can then freely use triggers for world interactions **without** resetting my emotes to neutral.",
