  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-08-08T15:43:07.120Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When Gestures are disabled in-game, this property is not respected by the GestureDirect inputs, as they get stuck in action and will not go back to idle/none until gestures are toggled on and off again without the input being initiated. Initiating the input will cause it to get stuck on again.\n\nThe ideal behaviour is that GestureDirect inputs should only activate *ever* if gestures are enabled when the input is initiated, and that the idle state should be able to be reached regardless of gesture on/off state, as to ensure they are never stuck on a gesture.",
